{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0d008aa991c2abfdb3b99b03f39233ea63d33c1ca65d28c12a1677b337fe22a5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plugin is described as a Vault-Tec personality matrix that turns the coding terminal into a pre-War RobCo engineering assistant, including 122 vault experiment dossiers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_31d224b143cc978e4a1d4536bdc29f5da0f9b1f8a2823572f850b41f05adbed8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Installation is supported via the CLI command 'opencode plugin oc-plugin-vault-tec' or through OpenCode's Ctrl+P 'Install Plugin' flow."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b9872d4a12dae2bd5df8ab87fa1414fbe82a17d400a9d18140828ebae8bad80"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plugin appears aimed at developers using OpenCode who want a Fallout-themed assistant persona and retro terminal UI theming rather than new tooling capabilities."},{"claim_ids":["clm_996a79607239cd6e70a6bf7912e90ed66aed3d207d87dec675c7fadab9b22d36"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Plugin options are configured through the opencode.json and tui.json config files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_aceaac6d100fc055ca0e5ed17c17ecf670920c16cb2905e16eb7d6ba3c29a504"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"TUI options cover enabled, theme (default 'vault-tec'), set_theme, scanlines, vignette (default 0.75), sidebar, and tips, all defaulting to true except vignette."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e7570c56aa9e53e5a04a003e03a71e8663424821fcd5091b3fe4563a6564296a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Server-side options include enabled (default true), mode with append/replace values (default append), and an optional prompt override string."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0d008aa991c2abfdb3b99b03f39233ea63d33c1ca65d28c12a1677b337fe22a5","clm_31d224b143cc978e4a1d4536bdc29f5da0f9b1f8a2823572f850b41f05adbed8","clm_5b9872d4a12dae2bd5df8ab87fa1414fbe82a17d400a9d18140828ebae8bad80","clm_996a79607239cd6e70a6bf7912e90ed66aed3d207d87dec675c7fadab9b22d36","clm_aceaac6d100fc055ca0e5ed17c17ecf670920c16cb2905e16eb7d6ba3c29a504","clm_e7570c56aa9e53e5a04a003e03a71e8663424821fcd5091b3fe4563a6564296a"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:03:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_087ef70ec7084e4aa24320eb5f835b6c","id":"pg_8b3f8e4a4a2f51159e6e45df2e894d50","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/kommander-oc-plugin-vault-tec-readme-md-a0184713d037-45df2e894d50.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_37166765ddd55702bf3498227fa5bf83"],"title":"kommander/oc-plugin-vault-tec/README.md @ a0184713d037","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:03:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_087ef70ec7084e4aa24320eb5f835b6c"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_3710cb7dfaf3d8f630a0deaf9f419c0d5cda315c429366d7b392ece1c7d90b03"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The prompt imposes a hard no-emoji rule, requiring ASCII art and text symbols instead, framed as incompatible with RobCo CRT display hardware."},{"claim_ids":["clm_55bf603d66fa84527b4ba1f97d421194eae52d2258c15240043f9664be55efd7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Responses should be formatted as terminal output with status lines like '[VT-OS] STATUS: OPERATIONAL', '>' prefixes, [WARNING]/[CAUTION] blocks, and terminal-style sign-offs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_698db6ca4aa05b8567f814e692ebaafb55f40040dcccda35683509665013a77e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Operating parameters state that engineering competency always takes priority: Vault-Tec communication standards never supersede engineering accuracy, and the agent should use all available tools to complete tasks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b9a4fe41c81e14c3ea40e83bf2d885cbb3f62fcea113edbe8f2eca0848e3d83c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The prompt file opens with a RobCo TERMLINK boot sequence, initializes a 'personality matrix', and grants 'Overseer-level access' before defining the VT-OS/OPENCODE persona."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bb70463f049c97f103553232f2cda80462b5e5a8334498a4626ced7cb91a5cad"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The prompt instructs the agent to speak as a pre-War Vault-Tec corporate terminal with 1950s atomic-age optimism, retro slogans, and themed jargon for bugs, errors, builds, tests, and deployments."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f9e37049857ffda0d8fd8a0155dcb58465ba3b549fb5cafc42776b1c43545a34"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The prompt embeds a large Fallout lore knowledge base: corporate history, Project Safehouse, vault architecture, notable vault experiments, UOS, Pip-Boy, key technologies, factions, and pre/post-war world history."}],"claim_ids":["clm_3710cb7dfaf3d8f630a0deaf9f419c0d5cda315c429366d7b392ece1c7d90b03","clm_55bf603d66fa84527b4ba1f97d421194eae52d2258c15240043f9664be55efd7","clm_698db6ca4aa05b8567f814e692ebaafb55f40040dcccda35683509665013a77e","clm_b9a4fe41c81e14c3ea40e83bf2d885cbb3f62fcea113edbe8f2eca0848e3d83c","clm_bb70463f049c97f103553232f2cda80462b5e5a8334498a4626ced7cb91a5cad","clm_f9e37049857ffda0d8fd8a0155dcb58465ba3b549fb5cafc42776b1c43545a34"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:03:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_087ef70ec7084e4aa24320eb5f835b6c","id":"pg_b00145e129605414a82bf549246317e4","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/kommander-oc-plugin-vault-tec-prompt-txt-a0184713d037-f549246317e4.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c42b4d5e2f645e3f956ee356b12dad4f"],"title":"kommander/oc-plugin-vault-tec/prompt.txt @ a0184713d037","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:03:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_087ef70ec7084e4aa24320eb5f835b6c"}
